          "supplier": "def-qsm-dt-channel-definition",
          "carrier": "items/def-qsm-dt-channel-definition.md",
          "status": "Current carrier status: published; inspected for this dependency interface.",
          "source_section": "Definition",
          "exact_statement": "Let $d,e\\geq1$ be integers, let $H_{\\mathrm{in}}=\\mathbb C^d$ and $H_{\\mathrm{out}}=\\mathbb C^e$ with their standard inner products, and write $M_d(\\mathbb C)$ and $M_e(\\mathbb C)$ for the complex linear maps on these spaces. A matrix $X$ is **positive semidefinite**, written $X\\geq0$, when it is Hermitian and $\\langle Xv,v\\rangle\\geq0$ for every vector $v$. The finite spectral convention in [[lem-qsm-matrix-state-calculus]] gives positive matrices their orthonormal eigenbases and positive square roots.\n\nA **positive map** is a complex-linear map $\\Phi:M_d(\\mathbb C)\\to M_e(\\mathbb C)$ such that $\\Phi(X)\\geq0$ whenever $X\\geq0$. For each integer $r\\geq1$, identify $M_r(\\mathbb C)\\otimes M_d(\\mathbb C)$ with matrices on $\\mathbb C^r\\otimes\\mathbb C^d$ in the ordered product basis. The map $\\Phi$ is **completely positive** when $\\operatorname{id}_r\\otimes\\Phi$ is positive for every such $r$, where $\\operatorname{id}_r$ is the identity map on $M_r(\\mathbb C)$.\n\nThe map $\\Phi$ is **trace-preserving** when $\\operatorname{Tr}(\\Phi(X))=\\operatorname{Tr}(X)$ for every $X\\in M_d(\\mathbb C)$. A **finite quantum channel** is a complex-linear map that is both completely positive and trace-preserving, abbreviated CPTP. Unitality, $\\Phi(I_d)=I_e$, is a separate condition and is not part of this definition.\n\nThis is a mathematical definition. A physical preparation, measurement, or open-system model must separately identify when one of these maps represents a physical transformation.",
          "relevant_hypotheses_and_conventions": "The exact selected section above gives the interface; the consumer invokes it under its stated finite-dimensional hypotheses.",
          "supplier_proof_status": "Supplier status is published; this carrier has no proof section, as appropriate to its kind. No independent approval is asserted.",
          "consumer_use": "Declared in the consumer reference interface; exact usage was inspected."
        }
